<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="554244234"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1800432240"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="私の心はチョココロネ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="私の心はチョココロネ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:13.367"><div begin="00:18.016" end="04:04.549"><p begin="00:18.016" end="00:22.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">そっと耳にあてると<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄地将耳朵靠近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so to mimi ni a te lu to</span></p><p begin="00:22.162" end="00:25.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">聞こえるココロの波音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那清晰可闻的心跳声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ko e lu ko ko lo no nami oto</span></p><p begin="00:25.780" end="00:29.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ときめきに甘い香りが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着甜甜的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki me ki ni ama i kao li ga</span></p><p begin="00:29.407" end="00:35.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">胸をざわざわ騒がせるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻柔地躁动着整个内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mune wo za wa za wa sawa ga se lu no</span></p><p begin="00:36.657" end="00:40.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">ぎゅっと詰まった私の想い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那深埋于心底的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gi yu to cu ma ta wataxi no omo i</span></p><p begin="00:40.530" end="00:43.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">君は知ってる？(You know?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可知晓？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi wa xi te lu ?</span></p><p begin="00:43.894" end="00:47.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ちょっぴり苦い日もあるけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然也有过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">qi yo pi li</span></p><p begin="00:47.711" end="00:53.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">どうか私を受け入れて…？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但还请接收这样的我吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka wataxi wo wu ke i re te ?</span></p><p begin="00:54.482" end="01:01.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">私の心はチョココロネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的内心就像巧克力螺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa qi yo ko ko lo ne</span></p><p begin="01:01.528" end="01:05.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">一口かじればあふれちゃう！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是轻轻咬下一口的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito kuqi ka ji re ba a fu re qi a wu</span></p><p begin="01:05.252" end="01:08.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">いろんなキモチがはじけちゃう！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会迸发出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i lo n na ki mo qi ga</span></p><p begin="01:08.779" end="01:15.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">私の心はドキドキね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心砰砰直跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa do ki do ki ne</span></p><p begin="01:15.967" end="01:19.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">ビタースイートにウラハラな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那与你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bi ta a su i i to ni</span></p><p begin="01:19.836" end="01:24.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">君と奏でるコルネットは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甜蜜与苦涩相互交织</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi to kana de lu ko lu ne to wa</span></p><p begin="01:24.891" end="01:33.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ゆっくり大切に感じたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐感受到了 那份重要的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku li tai secu ni kan ji ta no</span></p><p begin="01:43.999" end="01:48.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">そっと唱える君の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄地念叨着你的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so to tona e lu kimi no</span></p><p begin="01:48.119" end="01:51.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">名前が吐息で滲んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着叹息 渗入空气之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mae ga to iki de niji n da</span></p><p begin="01:51.666" end="01:55.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">うるうると揺らぐ瞳が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪光摇曳的眼眸里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wu lu wu lu to yu la gu hitomi ga</span></p><p begin="01:55.274" end="02:01.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">止まらないまま こぼれ落ちて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法抑制的泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma la na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:02.559" end="02:06.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">もっと呼んでよ 私のことを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更多地谈论</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to yo n de yo</span></p><p begin="02:06.473" end="02:09.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">君の笑顔で(Want you!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关于我的一切吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi no e gao de</span></p><p begin="02:09.924" end="02:13.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">なんとかヘコまないよう強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">透露着那无论如何都不服输的坚强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n to ka he ko ma na i yo u cuyo ku</span></p><p begin="02:13.590" end="02:19.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">どうか答えて「イエス」と...！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请用“是的”来回答吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka kota e te 「 i e su 」 to</span></p><p begin="02:20.338" end="02:27.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">私の心はチョココロネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的内心就像巧克力螺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa qi yo ko ko lo ne</span></p><p begin="02:27.487" end="02:31.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">一口かじればとろけちゃう！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是轻轻咬下一口的话 就会溶化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito kuqi ka ji re ba to lo ke qi a wu</span></p><p begin="02:31.082" end="02:34.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">愛しいオモイがとまらない！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经无法按捺那可怜的情感了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ito xi i o mo i ga to ma la na i</span></p><p begin="02:34.722" end="02:41.926" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">私の心はグルグルね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心犹豫不定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa gu lu gu lu ne</span></p><p begin="02:41.926" end="02:45.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">目が回りそうな迷路みたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目光遮遮掩掩 仿佛迷宫一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ga mawa li so u na mei lo mi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:45.766" end="02:50.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">君と味わうひとときは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一起 共度的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi to aji wa wu hi to to ki wa</span></p><p begin="02:50.876" end="03:00.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">いつか終わってしまう切なさで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却充斥着终有一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cu ka o wa te xi ma wu</span></p><p begin="03:07.495" end="03:08.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">(Love!Love!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Love！Love！)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Love love</span></p><p begin="03:08.971" end="03:12.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">大好きなんだもん！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最喜欢的人啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dai su ki na n da mo n</span></p><p begin="03:11.160" end="03:12.575" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">(Love!Love!)<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Love love</span></p><p begin="03:12.575" end="03:14.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">抑えきれないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已按捺不住了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Love love</span></p><p begin="03:14.318" end="03:17.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">苦さと甘さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦涩与甜蜜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">niga sa to ama sa</span></p><p begin="03:17.620" end="03:20.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">ふわふわ愛で包んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被柔软爱意包围的两个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu wa fu wa ai de cucu n de</span></p><p begin="03:20.414" end="03:25.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ふたりでひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">合而为一</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta li de hi to cu</span></p><p begin="03:26.600" end="03:33.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">私の心はチョココロネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的内心就像巧克力螺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa qi yo ko ko lo ne</span></p><p begin="03:33.861" end="03:37.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">一口かじればあふれちゃう！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是轻轻咬下一口的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito kuqi ka ji re ba a fu re qi a wu</span></p><p begin="03:37.453" end="03:41.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いろんなキモチがはじけちゃう！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会迸发出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i lo n na ki mo qi ga</span></p><p begin="03:41.090" end="03:48.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">私の心はドキドキね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心砰砰直跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wataxi no kokolo wa do ki do ki ne</span></p><p begin="03:48.190" end="03:52.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ビタースイートにウラハラな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那与你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bi ta a su i i to ni</span></p><p begin="03:52.274" end="03:57.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">君と奏でるコルネットは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甜蜜与苦涩相互交织</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi to kana de lu ko lu ne to wa</span></p><p begin="03:57.102" end="04:04.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ゆっくり大切に感じたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐感受到了 那份重要的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku li tai secu ni kan ji ta no</span></p></div></body></tt>